,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_frostpillar","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_22","text":"There are a bewildering amount of different flowers in this world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_23","text":"Not even I know how to raise each and every one of them properly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_24","text":"Each of them needs to grow in their own unique environment in order to flourish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_25","text":"It was a plant on which I had next to no information,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_26","text":"and so I tried to grow it in a variety of different environments.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_27","text":"I figured I could gather information and allow it to bloom more steadily in the future.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_28","text":"One never managed to sprout, no matter how much time passed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_29","text":"Another barely lifted its head and grew no further.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_30","text":"After the loss of those two, the other formed buds, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_31","text":"For some reason, it couldn't bloom and eventually withered away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_32","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_32","text":"Is that what you've been doing here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_33","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_33","text":"Attempting to ascertain which environments certain flowers thrive in?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_flora_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_flora_04_34","text":"Yes. That is my job.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter"